		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">Reported: Transfer line had a critical fault where the voltage monitor relay is tripped.</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">Findings: It's just a monitoring relay and shouldn't fault the system therefore, I masked it so that it won't cause critical fault.Remedy: Site electrician reset or replaced the relay.</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String"> </Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">25/08: </Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">Issue with baggage system</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">Transfer line had a critical fault where the voltage monitor relay is tripped.</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">It just an monitoring relay and shouldn't fault the system therefore I masked it so that it won't cause critical fault.</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">Site electrician will need to either reset or replace the relay.</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
