				<Data ss:Type="String">Bag sortation issue</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">Site reported they were having issue with BagSort again where the bags not able to sort. He said this had been on going and needed urgent assistance. I have contacted France to look into the issue.</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
