			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="50" ss:MergeAcross="13">
				<Data ss:Type="String"> A request was made to disable SL111c PE2 directly within the PLC/software code to resolve the disturbance.</Data>
			</Cell>
