				<Data ss:Type="String">DETAIL DE L'INTERVENTION / WORK DETAILS</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">Help:</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String"> </Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">Reported: Inbound baggage carousels 1 &amp; 2 at YLW are displaying as "offline" due to a communication fault.</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">Findings: IPs </Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="54" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">192.168.7.51</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String"> through </Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="54" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">.53</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String"> were successfully pinged from both the Glidepath server and a local laptop on the same subnet, ruling out a basic physical or network-layer drop.</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">Remedy: Review the IGS driver configuration and software service status, given the previous occurrence of this same fault.</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">2808: </Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String"> </Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">We have another comm fault at YLW with the baggage carousels 1 &amp; 2 showing as "offline."</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String"> </Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">We had a tech go out to the switching gear IB3SW. The switch was showing as online and all devices were actively working and connected to it.</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">We could ping 192.168.7.51-53 from the glidepath server and a laptop that we put onto the same subnet.</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String"> </Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="45" ss:MergeAcross="14">
				<Data ss:Type="String">I am hoping that you would have additional information on what might be going on with this and a potential solution.</Data>
			</Cell>
		</Row>
		<Row ss:AutoFitHeight="1">
			<Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="46" ss:MergeAcross="14"/>
		</Row>
